{"signature": "{\"text\": \"The rate of energy transfer through a wall depends not only on the material's thermal conductivity but also on the wall's thickness, area and temperature difference across it. Thicker insulation generally reduces the rate of transfer. Double glazing uses a gap containing air or another gas to reduce conduction and suppress convection. Loft insulation reduces energy transfer through the roof.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 27.533061, "words": [["The", 0.0], ["rate", 0.232], ["of", 0.58], ["energy", 0.836], ["transfer", 1.498], ["through", 2.078], ["a", 2.38], ["wall", 2.496], ["depends", 2.984], ["not", 3.541], ["only", 3.808], ["on", 4.133], ["the", 4.272], ["material's", 4.389], ["thermal", 4.992], ["conductivity", 5.445], ["but", 6.513], ["also", 6.745], ["on", 7.187], ["the", 7.338], ["wall's", 7.477], ["thickness,", 8.011], ["area", 8.998], ["and", 9.764], ["temperature", 10.077], ["difference", 10.67], ["across", 11.134], ["it.", 11.54], ["Thicker", 11.796], ["insulation", 12.202], ["generally", 12.98], ["reduces", 13.584], ["the", 14.187], ["rate", 14.362], ["of", 14.652], ["transfer.", 14.791], ["Double", 15.685], ["glazing", 16.091], ["uses", 16.683], ["a", 17.194], ["gap", 17.391], ["containing", 17.74], ["air", 18.425], ["or", 18.877], ["another", 19.168], ["gas", 19.597], ["to", 20.073], ["reduce", 20.282], ["conduction", 20.7], ["and", 21.42], ["suppress", 21.745], ["convection.", 22.326], ["Loft", 23.254], ["insulation", 23.707], ["reduces", 24.624], ["energy", 25.414], ["transfer", 25.948], ["through", 26.505], ["the", 26.795], ["roof.", 26.923]], "raw": [{"text": "The", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.139}, {"text": "rate", "start": 0.232, "end": 0.522}, {"text": "of", "start": 0.58, "end": 0.685}, {"text": "energy", "start": 0.836, "end": 1.382}, {"text": "transfer", "start": 1.498, "end": 2.02}, {"text": "through", "start": 2.078, "end": 2.334}, {"text": "a", "start": 2.38, "